WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.652
On the Install page, the Mac section has
two download links,

2
00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:09.074
one for Apple silicon and one for Intel.

3
00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:15.485
Choose Download for Apple silicon if your
Mac has an M1 or later chip.

4
00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:20.617
Your browser saves the disk image, about
145 megabytes,

5
00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:23.022
with the version in its name.

6
00:00:23.592 --> 00:00:27.097
When it says Done, the installer is ready
to open.
